WEBVTT

00:39.497 --> 00:43.043
This room will be vacant
while our young master stays in Songrim.

00:43.126 --> 00:45.920
Clean up his books and clothes.

00:46.004 --> 00:47.130
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

00:49.758 --> 00:54.012
He had left home a dozen times
and returned every time.

00:54.596 --> 00:57.056
You should wait a few days
in case he comes back again.

00:57.891 --> 00:59.142
It is different this time.

00:59.893 --> 01:02.854
He is a changed man.

01:04.147 --> 01:06.357
And he may bring home a wife soon.

01:07.067 --> 01:08.610
That is why we need to clean up.

01:09.277 --> 01:11.446
Is he getting engaged again?

01:12.363 --> 01:15.700
If this one falls through yet again,
he will never be able to get married.

01:16.284 --> 01:17.869
It is different this time.

01:17.952 --> 01:22.832
Young Master Jang has a lady
he has deep feelings for.

01:24.375 --> 01:25.460
Right, Mu-deok?

01:27.087 --> 01:29.756
The bird egg that he mentioned.

01:30.757 --> 01:34.803
I believe it is that lady
I met in Songrim.

01:35.595 --> 01:38.264
A bird egg on top of a tree.

01:38.348 --> 01:40.892
She must be a sophisticated woman

01:41.476 --> 01:43.269
whom he wants to protect.

01:43.353 --> 01:46.064
She must be someone like an egret.

01:46.147 --> 01:47.190
Like me.

01:47.273 --> 01:48.566
Who knows?

01:49.317 --> 01:54.030
Once it hatches,
it may turn out to be a vicious eagle,

01:54.114 --> 01:56.199
not a sophisticated egret.

01:56.783 --> 01:57.867
Is that so?

01:58.660 --> 02:00.245
A vicious eagle, how frightful.

02:01.079 --> 02:03.456
I hope it is not a woodpecker
or a cuckoo either.

02:03.540 --> 02:05.125
Do not worry.

02:05.708 --> 02:08.711
Once it hatches,
I am sure it will fly away.

02:10.296 --> 02:13.383
How could she
when she has feelings for him?

02:14.676 --> 02:19.347
If they were that close,
I am sure the feelings were mutual.

02:20.181 --> 02:22.392
The bird must be in love with him as well.

02:25.228 --> 02:27.397
I really hope it is Young Lady Heo.

02:28.273 --> 02:29.816
She resembles Madam Do-hwa too.

02:32.652 --> 02:33.987
- Mr. Lee.
- Yes?

02:34.070 --> 02:36.281
Leave those there.
They are Master Jang's books.

02:37.699 --> 02:39.117
Hurry up.

02:43.079 --> 02:45.165
What Uk and I shared

02:46.416 --> 02:48.543
was the desperate feeling of survival

02:51.921 --> 02:54.465
and the earnestness of finding ourselves.

03:04.100 --> 03:06.019
Once we got what we wanted,

03:07.395 --> 03:10.023
we promised to part ways
without looking back.

03:12.817 --> 03:15.069
The love that Maidservant Kim mentioned

03:17.530 --> 03:19.741
may have seeped in between us.

03:20.825 --> 03:25.496
But it is nothing but a shell
that I will leave behind once I hatch.

03:47.644 --> 03:50.939
You have already memorized
and written all of this down?

03:51.022 --> 03:54.817
Yes, please feel free to check.
I am certain I memorized everything.

03:57.737 --> 03:58.905
Even so,

03:58.988 --> 04:01.241
it should have taken you at least a month.

04:01.324 --> 04:05.036
I have served 12 masters so far
and thus have read the same book 12 times.

04:05.620 --> 04:06.746
You could say

04:06.829 --> 04:09.207
that this task was a piece of cake,
to say the least.

04:09.290 --> 04:12.710
I was wondering
why he agreed to obey the rules.

04:12.794 --> 04:14.337
He had his reasons.

04:14.420 --> 04:17.715
Now that I can leave Songrim
whenever I want, I will go home.

04:18.299 --> 04:19.509
Not so fast.

04:27.475 --> 04:29.060
Why not?

04:29.143 --> 04:32.272
The rules say that I can leave
once I master the basic education.

04:32.355 --> 04:34.524
When I asked you to read that,

04:34.607 --> 04:36.651
I did not simply mean to memorize it.

04:36.734 --> 04:38.653
I wanted you to engrave it in your heart.

04:39.487 --> 04:41.781
But since you were sly enough
to deceive us,

04:41.864 --> 04:45.159
I do not believe
that you have mastered this learning.

04:46.744 --> 04:48.162
I did not know

04:48.871 --> 04:51.749
that the leader could change
Songrim's rules however he wanted.

04:53.209 --> 04:54.043
Here you go.

04:54.752 --> 04:56.671
I have another task for you.

04:57.255 --> 04:59.507
If you read this book as well,

05:01.092 --> 05:04.137
then I will allow you
to leave Songrim whenever you wish.

05:07.682 --> 05:08.975
No!

05:16.482 --> 05:18.359
Are you sure that I can go outside

05:19.610 --> 05:21.070
after reading this book?

05:21.154 --> 05:22.238
That is right.

05:23.072 --> 05:25.867
I hope reading this book

05:26.617 --> 05:29.203
will be another piece of cake for you.

05:30.663 --> 05:32.332
This is terrible.

05:32.415 --> 05:34.751
Mu-deok will not be able
to see Uk for a while.

05:48.389 --> 05:50.058
What? This is empty.

05:52.477 --> 05:56.522
No, it is not.
There are words written on those papers.

05:57.774 --> 05:58.775
No, there are not.

05:58.858 --> 06:00.359
Do you see anything here?

06:01.736 --> 06:03.196
It is you who cannot see.

06:04.113 --> 06:06.657
You can only read it
once you focus your energy.

06:06.741 --> 06:09.243
That is Master Seo Gyeong's book,
Words of the Heart,

06:12.955 --> 06:13.915
I see.

06:14.874 --> 06:17.710
So there are actual words on these papers?

06:17.794 --> 06:20.505
So I am the only one who cannot read it?

06:25.593 --> 06:27.595
Your friend, Uk,

06:27.678 --> 06:29.430
must have not known what that book was.

06:29.514 --> 06:33.059
He has never received proper training.
Of course he would not know.

06:33.142 --> 06:35.019
He will be stuck in the Training Center

06:35.103 --> 06:36.562
until he can read it.

06:37.271 --> 06:38.439
I feel bad for him.

06:38.523 --> 06:40.399
He will probably
be stuck there for half a year.

06:41.442 --> 06:43.861
Even six months
would be too short for him.

06:43.945 --> 06:47.406
He mastered Ryusu
due to pure luck, not training.

06:48.324 --> 06:50.743
It will take him more than a year.

06:59.836 --> 07:02.463
How do you know that
when you were never given that book?

07:02.547 --> 07:05.424
I know you need
ample training to read that book.

07:05.508 --> 07:08.010
Then know that he is far ahead of you.

07:08.761 --> 07:10.429
Unlike him who received that book,

07:11.264 --> 07:12.640
you have not touched it yet.

07:17.770 --> 07:20.523
He is right. You should not gossip.

07:20.606 --> 07:21.691
Bye.

07:23.359 --> 07:24.527
Darn it.

07:29.574 --> 07:32.076
I wonder why my uncle
gave him that book already.

07:33.703 --> 07:34.954
I am baffled as well.

07:35.037 --> 07:38.791
He will not be able to do anything
while he is stuck there.

07:45.631 --> 07:46.716
I have

07:47.633 --> 07:49.677
no intention of training Uk.

07:50.303 --> 07:53.639
I am going to keep him near me
and check up on him

07:53.723 --> 07:56.559
so that he will not cause
any trouble outside.

07:56.642 --> 08:01.564
So you did not take him under your wing.
You just locked him up in Songrim.

08:03.191 --> 08:05.651
Since Uk has entered Songrim with a fuss,

08:06.235 --> 08:07.862
his father will be coming.

08:07.945 --> 08:10.031
By "father", do you mean Jang Gang?

08:10.114 --> 08:13.117
Jang Gang's biggest fear
was that Uk's gate of energy would be open

08:14.660 --> 08:17.330
and that he would go out into the open.

08:17.914 --> 08:19.290
Once he gets wind of this,

08:20.208 --> 08:22.084
he will come.

08:22.168 --> 08:26.506
The Gwanju needs to return
in order to get rid of Jin Mu.

08:27.757 --> 08:29.675
Everything will be solved

08:31.135 --> 08:33.304
once he returns.

08:34.931 --> 08:37.016
I feel bad for Uk.

08:37.850 --> 08:39.769
He came this far

08:39.852 --> 08:42.104
without receiving any training.

08:42.188 --> 08:43.564
How can he read Words of the Heart?

08:43.648 --> 08:44.899
It is an impossible task.

08:53.407 --> 08:55.868
Why would you give him these snacks?

08:56.786 --> 08:58.746
I heard some things
about Young Master Jang.

08:58.829 --> 09:01.123
He has a complicated family history,
barely any skills,

09:01.207 --> 09:03.501
- and a terrible personality.
- That is not true.

09:05.711 --> 09:06.879
He is a good man.

09:06.963 --> 09:09.048
Why would you think that?

09:09.131 --> 09:10.675
He is so fussy

09:10.758 --> 09:13.970
that the only person who can put up
with him is the maid Mu-deok.

09:16.222 --> 09:17.765
- Mu-deok?
- Yes.

09:17.848 --> 09:20.810
She is the maid who is always by his side.

09:25.982 --> 09:27.149
Mu-deok.

09:27.817 --> 09:30.486
I heard you stayed by my side all night.

09:30.570 --> 09:33.698
I thought you were Mu-deok.
I apologize for the trouble.

09:35.241 --> 09:37.952
So that is why he thought I was her.

09:44.083 --> 09:45.167
Hello.

09:47.378 --> 09:48.796
We are from Sejukwon.

09:49.672 --> 09:51.090
This way, my lady.

10:29.086 --> 10:31.422
Wait. The fire…

10:57.698 --> 10:58.699
Here you go.

10:58.783 --> 11:00.409
I have another task for you.

11:05.831 --> 11:07.083
He deceived me.

11:07.166 --> 11:09.126
He did a number on me!

11:26.268 --> 11:28.104
Hey, we meet again.

11:28.187 --> 11:31.941
Hello. Are you going somewhere?

11:32.024 --> 11:34.402
Well, yes. I need to meet someone outside.

11:35.694 --> 11:37.571
But why are you leaving that way?

11:39.865 --> 11:41.200
Because I am running away.

11:43.244 --> 11:45.996
Please turn a blind eye to this as well.

11:49.500 --> 11:53.796
My gosh. Young Lady Heo is so impatient.
Why did she not wait for me?

11:53.879 --> 11:56.215
Why did she leave me behind?

12:00.845 --> 12:02.221
What is the matter?

12:03.848 --> 12:05.391
Is Jang Uk not in his room?

12:05.975 --> 12:07.560
Yes, he is.

12:08.185 --> 12:09.520
Let us go upstairs then.

12:09.603 --> 12:13.315
I need to talk to him.

12:13.399 --> 12:15.109
In private, please.

12:17.611 --> 12:20.781
This will take some time. Wait outside.

12:40.634 --> 12:43.596
Mu-deok, the young master
from Songrim is here.

12:43.679 --> 12:45.181
He is looking for you.

13:02.865 --> 13:04.533
Hello, Young Master Seo.

13:07.119 --> 13:08.829
You must have been expecting Uk.

13:10.789 --> 13:12.833
He will not be back for some time.

13:13.626 --> 13:15.544
He was given a difficult task to complete.

13:16.295 --> 13:17.796
He will do well.

13:18.672 --> 13:20.758
It is most crucial for him to remain there

13:21.342 --> 13:23.844
and receive training as of now.

13:24.595 --> 13:27.598
I was concerned after how you left
that day, but you look fine.

13:28.641 --> 13:30.518
What have you been doing?

13:31.268 --> 13:34.980
I am just a maid here,
so I have been doing housework.

13:35.773 --> 13:37.983
Maidservant Kim is away at the moment.

13:38.067 --> 13:39.568
You can wait in the study.

13:40.152 --> 13:41.904
I am here to see you, not her.

13:43.906 --> 13:44.949
Me?

13:45.658 --> 13:48.327
Why would you want to see me?

13:49.161 --> 13:50.204
Well…

13:50.829 --> 13:52.039
The umbrella.

13:52.957 --> 13:56.710
I came to get the umbrella
I had lent you that day.

13:58.087 --> 13:59.463
That umbrella?

13:59.547 --> 14:02.341
The wind tore it open
on my way home, so I threw it away.

14:03.759 --> 14:04.718
Is that so?

14:07.054 --> 14:08.013
Then let us go.

14:08.722 --> 14:09.557
What?

14:09.640 --> 14:11.225
We should get a new one.

14:11.308 --> 14:13.936
You need to buy me a new umbrella.

14:16.564 --> 14:19.358
UMBRELLAS

14:22.611 --> 14:25.447
This looks exactly like
the umbrella you lent me.

14:25.531 --> 14:26.907
That is made of low-quality…

14:28.784 --> 14:31.120
That is a disposable umbrella
made of low-quality paper.

14:31.203 --> 14:33.372
Mine was made
from high-quality sheepskin and bamboo.

14:34.957 --> 14:36.375
High-quality, you say?

14:37.084 --> 14:39.378
Why did you give a maid
such an expensive umbrella?

14:39.461 --> 14:41.380
I had only lent it to you.

14:41.463 --> 14:43.632
You should compensate for losing it.

14:46.343 --> 14:48.596
And that was my one and only umbrella.

14:48.679 --> 14:51.807
Why would a young master like you
only have one umbrella?

14:51.891 --> 14:54.018
I rarely go out when it is raining.

14:55.227 --> 14:59.148
I had hurt my leg as a child,
and it still hurts when it rains.

15:00.316 --> 15:03.444
Is your broken leg still giving you pain?

15:07.698 --> 15:10.618
Young Master Park told me
about how you had broken your leg.

15:12.036 --> 15:13.871
Yes, back in Danhyanggok.

15:13.954 --> 15:17.583
I pity you for being a mage
who has a weak leg.

15:18.375 --> 15:20.794
Your leg probably did not heal properly.

15:23.213 --> 15:24.506
There was a friend

15:25.382 --> 15:27.676
who used to wait for me in Danhyanggok.

15:30.262 --> 15:32.473
She saved me and treated my wound.

15:33.724 --> 15:35.976
My leg must not have healed properly

15:37.519 --> 15:39.104
because I had not thanked her.

15:52.618 --> 15:54.620
- I like this one.
- Pardon?

15:54.703 --> 15:56.789
I will take this one. Go and pay for it.

15:58.916 --> 16:00.167
Yes, Young Master Seo.

16:04.964 --> 16:06.507
- We will take this one.
- All right.

16:06.590 --> 16:09.051
Please put it on Master Jang Gang's tab.

16:09.635 --> 16:12.513
Why would you do that?
You should pay for it.

16:13.138 --> 16:15.557
A maid like me has no money.

16:15.641 --> 16:16.892
Of course, you do.

16:17.393 --> 16:19.019
I saw you go out

16:19.103 --> 16:21.397
and buy clothes
with the money you keep hidden.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.856
That was because…

16:27.736 --> 16:30.572
- How much is it?
- You have a good eye.

16:30.656 --> 16:33.117
That is our most expensive umbrella.

16:38.455 --> 16:39.540
Darn it.

16:45.045 --> 16:46.255
Mu-deok is not here?

16:47.423 --> 16:50.300
Why did she have to be away
now of all times?

16:50.384 --> 16:52.886
Young Master Jang,
were you kicked out again?

16:53.470 --> 16:55.973
No, I was not.
I only stopped by for a minute.

16:56.056 --> 16:57.891
I will be going back soon.

16:57.975 --> 16:58.809
I see.

16:58.892 --> 17:00.728
Mu-deok will be here soon.

17:01.311 --> 17:03.772
Should I prepare a bath for you
in the meantime?

17:04.481 --> 17:05.399
That sounds nice.

17:05.482 --> 17:07.901
It has been a while
since I last bathed in this house.

17:07.985 --> 17:10.154
- I will get it ready then.
- Sure.

17:26.086 --> 17:27.379
Hold on.

17:28.589 --> 17:30.799
Were our honey biscuits always this sweet?

17:33.010 --> 17:35.387
Why does Songrim not have any snacks?

17:35.971 --> 17:38.098
Our leader also had a sweet tooth
back in the day.

17:55.282 --> 17:59.203
Are we breaking up today?

18:00.120 --> 18:01.538
Yes.

18:02.122 --> 18:05.167
The three big-mouthed sisters will be done
with their floriculture class

18:05.250 --> 18:06.460
and will pass us by soon.

18:07.044 --> 18:09.338
If we argue in front of them then,

18:09.421 --> 18:12.049
they will gossip about how we broke up.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.515
As I promised,

18:19.598 --> 18:22.017
I will be the reason for our breakup.

18:22.643 --> 18:25.062
First, slap me hard across my face.

18:25.145 --> 18:27.940
Then push me away
when I cling onto you and leave.

18:28.524 --> 18:30.567
That seems a bit extreme…

18:30.651 --> 18:32.361
We have to go that far

18:32.444 --> 18:35.447
for them to believe
that we really broke off our engagement.

18:35.531 --> 18:39.034
Then people will bad-mouth you.

18:39.118 --> 18:42.621
There will be no matchmaking for you
if you have a bad reputation.

18:45.541 --> 18:46.708
I do not wish

18:47.417 --> 18:49.461
to get married by matchmaking.

18:53.090 --> 18:54.758
I will marry the woman

18:55.884 --> 18:57.094
who I like.

19:05.853 --> 19:07.187
Still, slapping is too much.

19:08.564 --> 19:11.150
I will pour this on you instead.

19:11.733 --> 19:14.653
Sure. You can do that.

19:18.115 --> 19:19.616
The tea is too hot.

19:20.784 --> 19:22.911
Your face will burn.

19:28.250 --> 19:29.710
Goodness.

19:30.544 --> 19:31.795
It is fine.

19:33.881 --> 19:37.301
There will be a magic show in a few days.

19:39.011 --> 19:40.762
I really wanted to watch it.

19:41.471 --> 19:44.349
But I will not be able to
if we break up today.

19:44.975 --> 19:47.227
Wait. Why not?

19:47.311 --> 19:51.148
Up until now,
I stayed home for at least a month

19:52.065 --> 19:54.401
after breaking off an engagement.

19:55.777 --> 19:58.197
I see.

20:01.992 --> 20:06.163
Then should we postpone
our breakup for a few days?

20:06.246 --> 20:07.080
Should we?

20:10.167 --> 20:13.295
But those three sisters will be there too.

20:14.129 --> 20:17.549
I do not think I should go there alone.

20:18.550 --> 20:22.221
Then since they think
we are a couple, I will go with you.

20:24.514 --> 20:26.808
Well, I suppose.

20:31.813 --> 20:34.566
I would like
some pumpkin taffy, rice taffy,

20:34.650 --> 20:36.693
and honey biscuits.

20:36.777 --> 20:37.945
Sure.

20:39.571 --> 20:41.657
My young master is like a child.

20:41.740 --> 20:43.867
He gets cranky
when there are no snacks around.

20:44.785 --> 20:45.994
Please give them to him.

20:48.997 --> 20:51.291
I like these pine pollen tea snacks.

20:51.375 --> 20:54.002
I suspected you would have
expensive tastes.

20:54.086 --> 20:56.463
- Would you like some of that too?
- No, thank you.

21:07.766 --> 21:09.935
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

21:11.937 --> 21:13.355
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

21:13.438 --> 21:16.400
QUALIFICATIONS: HEALTHY, LITERATE,
CAN CALCULATE, NO CRIMINAL RECORD

21:18.860 --> 21:20.946
I will put this on the Jang family's tab.

21:27.411 --> 21:29.079
Please give these to Young Master Jang.

21:30.205 --> 21:33.792
I have some business
to take care of. Goodbye.

21:50.892 --> 21:51.935
Here you go.

21:52.019 --> 21:53.437
- Have a look around.
- I will.

21:54.229 --> 21:55.355
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

21:55.439 --> 21:56.606
Goodbye.

22:01.820 --> 22:03.864
It is her, right?

22:03.947 --> 22:05.115
It is her.

22:06.908 --> 22:08.118
Hey.

22:08.201 --> 22:10.370
- You took my purse, right?
- Give me back my ring.

22:15.334 --> 22:16.877
- Goodness!
- Where is she?

22:16.960 --> 22:19.421
- Hey! Stop right there!
- Hey!

22:19.504 --> 22:20.672
Stop right there!

22:20.756 --> 22:23.050
- You!
- Stop that swindler!

22:23.133 --> 22:25.510
- Thief!
- Hey, come back here!

22:25.594 --> 22:28.889
- Goodness!
- Just wait until I get my hands on you!

22:29.473 --> 22:31.516
- Hey! Stop!
- Wait for me!

22:31.600 --> 22:33.685
- Darn it.
- Hey!

22:33.769 --> 22:35.437
- Hurry up!
- What are you doing?

22:35.520 --> 22:36.646
You little…

22:36.730 --> 22:38.356
Catch that swindler!

22:38.440 --> 22:40.567
- She got away.
- Hey.

22:40.650 --> 22:42.486
- That is her, right?
- Yes.

22:49.826 --> 22:51.328
That is Mu-deok.

22:51.411 --> 22:52.245
Mu-deok!

22:57.751 --> 22:59.336
There you are, you…

22:59.419 --> 23:01.088
- You.
- Catch that thief!

23:01.171 --> 23:04.216
Come here.
Wait until I get my hands on you.

23:04.299 --> 23:05.550
Hey!

23:05.634 --> 23:06.802
You little…

23:19.064 --> 23:20.607
It was definitely her.

23:22.400 --> 23:24.236
But how can she see now?

23:38.041 --> 23:40.210
She had always covered her eyes with this.

23:42.337 --> 23:43.964
Was it not her?

24:03.775 --> 24:05.527
We finally meet again,

24:06.361 --> 24:07.487
So-i.

24:08.071 --> 24:11.074
I went all the way to Sari Village
because I heard you were there.

24:11.158 --> 24:12.784
But you were long gone.

24:13.410 --> 24:15.620
Did you think hiding
in the capital would work?

24:17.414 --> 24:18.331
What is this?

24:19.708 --> 24:23.295
Were you pretending to be blind?

24:25.589 --> 24:28.008
But then again,
you did put up a nice, pitiful front.

24:28.091 --> 24:31.511
Then you would betray others
behind their backs.

24:33.972 --> 24:35.182
How dare you steal

24:36.641 --> 24:38.435
my money?

24:40.520 --> 24:42.230
I do not know what you are--

24:43.982 --> 24:45.901
Jeez…

24:46.693 --> 24:50.030
Look at you trying to deceive me again.

24:50.655 --> 24:51.531
Take her.

24:56.077 --> 24:57.287
Help me!

24:57.370 --> 24:59.039
Somebody, please help me!

25:01.374 --> 25:03.627
I am blind!

25:03.710 --> 25:06.087
I do not know them,

25:06.171 --> 25:08.548
yet they are trying to kidnap me!

25:09.257 --> 25:12.886
Someone, please help me!

25:12.969 --> 25:15.555
Look at you trying real hard.

25:18.475 --> 25:19.434
Please help me!

25:19.517 --> 25:20.769
What are you all looking at?

25:20.852 --> 25:23.271
- Come here.
- Let me go!

25:33.949 --> 25:36.493
You cannot drag her against her will.

25:37.619 --> 25:40.288
I have a good reason for doing this,

25:40.372 --> 25:41.831
so just go on your way.

25:42.540 --> 25:44.376
I cannot see,

25:44.459 --> 25:46.419
- and I do not know who they are.
- You little--

25:49.047 --> 25:50.298
Get him!

26:02.352 --> 26:04.104
He is a mage.

26:04.187 --> 26:05.313
Let us go!

26:13.613 --> 26:14.990
Can you stand?

26:20.245 --> 26:21.788
Thank you.

26:21.871 --> 26:23.623
They look like dangerous men.

26:23.707 --> 26:25.917
You should ask the authorities for help.

26:26.668 --> 26:27.711
I will take you there.

26:27.794 --> 26:30.588
That is all right.
I do not need their help.

26:32.299 --> 26:33.758
Your cane is broken.

26:40.390 --> 26:41.349
This is an umbrella.

26:42.392 --> 26:43.685
You can use this as a cane.

27:00.618 --> 27:03.204
Master, it is best to just let her be.

27:03.288 --> 27:05.832
She refused to be taken
to the authorities.

27:05.915 --> 27:08.209
I do not know what kind of past she has,

27:08.293 --> 27:10.045
but those were thugs.

27:10.712 --> 27:14.883
Nothing good will come out
of involving yourself in their affairs.

27:24.476 --> 27:25.643
I will take you there.

27:26.519 --> 27:28.938
You should ask the authorities for help.

27:33.193 --> 27:35.070
Maybe I should have said yes.

27:56.132 --> 27:58.718
Number 125.

28:00.220 --> 28:02.722
Did these many people
already sign up for it?

28:02.806 --> 28:04.140
ONE HUNDRED TWENTY-FIVE

28:05.225 --> 28:07.060
They are only picking five people.

28:08.269 --> 28:10.355
Do I have hope?

28:10.939 --> 28:12.065
Hey, Mu-deok.

28:13.691 --> 28:14.901
Were you here all along?

28:14.984 --> 28:16.444
The young master was looking for you.

28:16.528 --> 28:18.988
Did Young Master Seo come by again?

28:19.072 --> 28:21.157
Not him. Young Master Jang.

28:21.908 --> 28:24.828
Young Master Jang snuck out
and has come home.

28:34.087 --> 28:37.632
I need to go back before sundown.
Where in the world is she?

29:20.300 --> 29:21.426
Where is Young Master Jang?

29:21.509 --> 29:23.678
He just left,
but I did not see him either.

29:26.222 --> 29:28.266
He said he would be obedient,
so why did he escape?

29:30.143 --> 29:31.936
I hope he does not get caught.

29:34.939 --> 29:36.357
He just left.

29:36.941 --> 29:37.942
Just now.

29:39.861 --> 29:41.654
What is with her?

30:06.137 --> 30:07.305
Jang Uk.

30:07.889 --> 30:08.807
Young Master!

30:13.561 --> 30:16.314
Where have you been?
I thought I would not get to see you.

30:45.385 --> 30:47.762
I finally got to see you. I am glad.

30:50.348 --> 30:52.809
I need to go.
They cannot know that I am gone.

30:53.726 --> 30:56.354
Wait there. I will go to you soon.

30:58.022 --> 31:02.235
I found a way,
so do what you need to do in there.

31:02.318 --> 31:04.028
I will do what I can out here.

31:05.446 --> 31:08.074
All right. But what way is that?

31:09.450 --> 31:11.369
Songrim is hiring.

31:32.056 --> 31:33.266
Do not get caught and get back safely.

31:59.292 --> 32:02.503
Your Royal Highness,
instead of going to Sejukwon yourself,

32:02.587 --> 32:04.589
you should summon
Master Heo to your palace.

32:06.090 --> 32:09.385
That is all right.
It gives me a reason to come out.

32:09.469 --> 32:10.970
I like taking strolls.

32:16.976 --> 32:18.061
Is that not Jang Uk?

32:28.237 --> 32:29.864
Why are you out here?

32:29.948 --> 32:32.033
I heard you could not leave
the Training Center

32:32.116 --> 32:33.826
until you could read Words of the Heart.

32:33.910 --> 32:36.329
Not only did you follow me
to where I was drinking,

32:36.412 --> 32:38.081
but you are also keeping tabs on me.

32:38.790 --> 32:41.960
Why are you so interested in me?
It is making me uncomfortable.

32:42.043 --> 32:44.045
Master Heo from Sejukwon told me.

32:45.004 --> 32:48.633
Right. I heard you fell ill
after drinking the liquor I had given you.

32:48.716 --> 32:51.010
Then why did you come to Sejukwon?

32:51.719 --> 32:56.224
Does it still hurt where I hit you?

32:56.307 --> 32:57.392
Oh, dear.

32:57.475 --> 33:00.561
Not at all. I am all better now.

33:00.645 --> 33:03.106
I only go there to get some supplements.

33:03.898 --> 33:07.360
I hope you take many good supplements.
You must live a long, healthy life.

33:09.404 --> 33:12.115
What were you hiding just a while ago?

33:13.199 --> 33:14.200
Let me see it.

33:31.843 --> 33:32.885
It is a honey biscuit.

33:33.469 --> 33:36.139
I wanted to eat it for myself.
How did you know?

33:36.723 --> 33:37.849
You can have it.

33:44.188 --> 33:47.275
Songrim does not have
these kinds of snacks.

33:48.735 --> 33:49.861
Did you go home?

33:56.784 --> 33:59.912
You will be in trouble
if they find out you have sneaked out.

34:00.538 --> 34:03.791
You even gave me a congratulatory drink
and complimented me.

34:03.875 --> 34:06.836
Will you seriously tattle on me
for this little misdeed?

34:10.465 --> 34:12.884
After all, I even gave you
that honey biscuit.

34:18.222 --> 34:22.602
Stay away from that big pine tree.
I saw a group of mages there.

34:25.563 --> 34:27.690
Thank you, Your Royal Highness. Goodbye.

34:31.986 --> 34:34.072
I do not understand
why I am being nice to him.

34:38.576 --> 34:40.119
This is tasty.

34:40.912 --> 34:42.080
Is it?

34:46.084 --> 34:47.877
- Is it tasty, Your Royal Highness?
- Yes.

34:48.461 --> 34:50.421
I thought the Crown Prince

34:51.297 --> 34:54.008
would be hostile
toward Songrim after the match.

34:55.176 --> 34:57.095
Rather, he has sheathed his sword

34:57.762 --> 34:59.931
and become closer to them.

35:00.556 --> 35:03.810
He must have decided to befriend them
so that they could be of use

35:03.893 --> 35:05.520
when he becomes the next king.

35:07.230 --> 35:10.608
Are you sure we do not need
to do anything about it?

35:10.691 --> 35:11.943
Do not worry.

35:12.026 --> 35:13.986
We can easily change his mind.

35:14.612 --> 35:16.948
We have Jang Uk's constellation plate.

35:18.741 --> 35:22.203
The Crown Prince will have no choice
but to kill him eventually.

35:33.172 --> 35:37.760
Is that what we will use
to subdue Jin Ho-gyeong?

35:37.844 --> 35:41.180
Jinyowon will be ours soon.

36:01.826 --> 36:04.412
It has been four hours
since Young Lady Heo went inside.

36:07.123 --> 36:08.374
Do not bother them.

36:08.457 --> 36:09.792
They must have a lot to talk about.

36:13.504 --> 36:16.299
Hey! Wait!

36:17.300 --> 36:19.552
You should not bother them.

36:19.635 --> 36:20.803
Something is not right.

36:20.887 --> 36:23.097
I must check whether or not
Jang Uk is in there.

36:23.181 --> 36:25.391
Are you doubting my lady?

36:27.268 --> 36:28.311
Gosh.

36:30.980 --> 36:33.024
Why is he not here yet?

36:34.734 --> 36:38.154
It will be awkward
if they find out he is not here.

36:48.289 --> 36:50.166
Why are you here? What are you doing?

36:51.125 --> 36:55.296
I told them we were in here together
so they would not catch you leaving.

36:56.339 --> 36:58.216
I have been waiting for your return.

37:04.764 --> 37:07.767
See? They are together.

37:09.810 --> 37:11.145
I will go now.

37:11.646 --> 37:14.732
I had a great chat with you today.

37:16.108 --> 37:17.318
Likewise.

37:17.902 --> 37:19.195
Goodbye.

37:29.705 --> 37:31.958
What were you doing here
for the past four hours?

37:33.376 --> 37:34.585
Beats me.

37:35.378 --> 37:38.798
What were we doing here for that long?

38:01.279 --> 38:02.738
She must have been bored.

38:07.159 --> 38:09.620
You want to become a servant of Songrim?

38:10.204 --> 38:12.248
Yes, ma'am. Look what happened today.

38:12.331 --> 38:16.627
Young Master Jang needs me
by his side at all times.

38:17.461 --> 38:18.421
I agree.

38:19.171 --> 38:22.800
He must have been so uncomfortable
that he came here to bathe and eat snacks.

38:23.634 --> 38:26.929
Our young master is very sensitive
and has been doted on growing up.

38:27.013 --> 38:29.223
Living with others in Songrim
does not suit him.

38:29.807 --> 38:31.058
ONE HUNDRED TWENTY-FIVE

38:31.142 --> 38:32.351
I already signed up.

38:33.269 --> 38:34.395
I will get in at all costs.

38:35.396 --> 38:37.315
Hey, you do not need that.

38:37.982 --> 38:39.483
This is the Jang family.

38:39.567 --> 38:41.027
We can easily put you in there.

38:41.652 --> 38:42.570
Is that true?

38:42.653 --> 38:45.656
Does that mean
I do not need to take the test?

38:45.740 --> 38:48.284
Of course not. Just trust me.

38:51.495 --> 38:52.955
That is not possible.

38:53.622 --> 38:57.460
Songrim's servants are only chosen
through open recruitments.

38:57.543 --> 38:58.794
There is no exception.

38:58.878 --> 39:01.047
I am not asking you
to give her a free position.

39:01.130 --> 39:03.883
She just needs the entrance plaque.
Just register her name

39:03.966 --> 39:05.551
so she can get one.

39:05.634 --> 39:07.386
We will pay you monthly.

39:10.931 --> 39:12.183
Also…

39:12.850 --> 39:13.893
Here.

39:15.353 --> 39:18.564
I thought it would suit you,
so I got you one, Maidservant Park.

39:23.402 --> 39:24.612
Here.

39:49.595 --> 39:53.474
Word has it that you bribed

39:53.557 --> 39:57.436
Maidservant Park of Songrim with this.

39:58.062 --> 40:01.148
- It was purely a gift…
- I heard you asked her

40:02.066 --> 40:04.402
to give Mu-deok a spot there.

40:04.485 --> 40:07.530
Since our young master is so sensitive,

40:07.613 --> 40:09.573
I thought having Mu-deok by his side

40:09.657 --> 40:13.619
would help him with his training,
so I asked for a favor.

40:15.162 --> 40:16.372
So this truly was a bribe!

40:17.748 --> 40:21.043
I apologize. It was thoughtless of me.

40:21.127 --> 40:23.170
When Maidservant Park brought this to me,

40:23.254 --> 40:26.090
I vehemently told her
that you were not one to do such a thing.

40:26.882 --> 40:28.008
I defended you.

40:28.092 --> 40:32.096
How will I dare face her ever again?

40:32.179 --> 40:33.431
I…

40:37.726 --> 40:40.187
I will apologize to her.

40:40.813 --> 40:42.022
What will everyone think?

40:42.857 --> 40:46.318
They will think you abused
your relationship with me

40:46.402 --> 40:48.279
to bribe someone.

40:48.362 --> 40:51.824
I did give her that scarf,
but I never mentioned you to her.

40:51.907 --> 40:53.075
Even so,

40:53.159 --> 40:55.786
everyone in Songrim knows
that you and I are close.

40:55.870 --> 40:59.540
If you do this, I can no longer…

41:02.918 --> 41:06.964
have a close relationship with you.

41:08.799 --> 41:12.511
In that case, I will stop coming here.

41:13.679 --> 41:14.889
And what did you say?

41:14.972 --> 41:18.601
Was our relationship ever that deep?

41:19.226 --> 41:21.020
If we were truly close,

41:21.103 --> 41:24.148
you would not have mentioned
cutting ties with me so easily.

41:24.231 --> 41:25.566
Fine.

41:26.275 --> 41:29.612
- Maidservant Kim, I…
- I will tell Maidservant Park

41:29.695 --> 41:32.114
that I, who bribes people,

41:32.198 --> 41:33.616
am not close

41:33.699 --> 41:36.827
with the leader of Songrim even one bit.

41:36.911 --> 41:38.204
- Look--
- All right.

41:38.787 --> 41:40.789
I am terribly sorry

41:40.873 --> 41:42.249
that I made you lose face.

41:43.125 --> 41:44.627
Maidservant Kim.

41:46.378 --> 41:48.297
You cannot just leave like that.

41:55.179 --> 41:56.388
Take this.

41:58.349 --> 42:01.852
I would be accepting this bribe
if I were to keep it.

42:18.827 --> 42:20.538
Also…

42:21.789 --> 42:23.791
I did not mean

42:25.459 --> 42:28.629
that I did not want you to come…

42:28.712 --> 42:29.797
Maid--

42:29.880 --> 42:31.549
Maidservant Kim!

42:36.887 --> 42:38.097
This is difficult.

42:55.990 --> 42:57.491
You cannot do it yet.

43:00.244 --> 43:01.370
Master Lee.

43:02.037 --> 43:04.957
You cannot read that book
with the concentration you have now.

43:05.624 --> 43:08.794
You have never trained diligently
like the others have.

43:08.877 --> 43:11.880
How long will it take
if I start training now?

43:11.964 --> 43:14.383
The earliest would be in a year.

43:15.426 --> 43:18.637
I cannot do that. I refuse
to be stuck in here for that long.

43:18.721 --> 43:21.849
I think that is exactly the reason
why Park Jin gave you that book.

43:26.395 --> 43:27.855
You could shorten that time

43:28.606 --> 43:32.359
if you become my pupil
and receive my teachings.

43:32.443 --> 43:33.611
Do you mean

43:34.987 --> 43:36.697
by drinking that chaste herb tea?

43:39.950 --> 43:42.286
Please give me some time to think.

43:43.704 --> 43:46.123
This book contains my master,

43:46.206 --> 43:50.544
Master Seo Gyeong's poem.

43:50.628 --> 43:51.795
Poem?

43:51.879 --> 43:53.881
It is not that long.

43:54.882 --> 43:57.468
Once you read the first word,

43:57.551 --> 43:59.511
the rest will come easily to you.

44:00.971 --> 44:03.724
Right. You cannot read this yet, can you?

44:04.683 --> 44:07.728
Are you having fun teasing me?
It is not like you will tell me.

44:07.811 --> 44:09.104
It is quite entertaining to watch.

44:11.106 --> 44:13.609
Shall I help you again this time?

44:15.486 --> 44:16.320
Yes, please.

44:17.237 --> 44:20.616
Let me tell you one secret
about this book that no one knows of.

44:21.909 --> 44:25.496
This poem is actually a love letter.

44:27.081 --> 44:28.457
A love letter?

44:28.540 --> 44:29.583
That is right.

44:29.667 --> 44:33.587
Countless mages have read this,
but no one knows that fact.

44:37.508 --> 44:41.553
Master Seo Gyeong wrote this
for a lady who could not see

44:41.637 --> 44:44.473
so that she could read it with her heart.

44:49.103 --> 44:52.314
You can read it by training
your concentration skills.

44:52.398 --> 44:56.402
But try to think of another way
since I told you it was a love letter.

44:57.986 --> 45:01.698
How does a love letter begin?

45:08.956 --> 45:10.124
What is this?

45:13.127 --> 45:14.378
Was he a pervert?

45:14.461 --> 45:18.048
Why would he make others
read his love letter?

45:18.549 --> 45:21.260
Why must I read this?
It is invisible to me.

45:22.094 --> 45:23.637
Was he really a pervert?

45:26.598 --> 45:31.019
Master Lee, it is getting colder now.
Instead of returning to Danhyanggok,

45:31.103 --> 45:34.231
how about you stay here?
I will treat you well.

45:34.982 --> 45:36.024
Yeom.

45:36.108 --> 45:40.821
I cannot train by wearing warm clothes
and feeling comfortable.

45:40.904 --> 45:45.075
I am just a pupil
who wants his master to be warm.

45:48.662 --> 45:51.540
I guess you have matured with age.

46:09.600 --> 46:12.144
That is Maidservant Kim
from the Jang family.

46:12.728 --> 46:15.731
Seeing how she looks unhappy,
she must have fought with Jin again.

46:17.232 --> 46:19.109
Goodness. Hello.

46:23.655 --> 46:24.907
Master Lee.

46:25.741 --> 46:28.160
Why did you leave so quickly last time?

46:28.243 --> 46:29.953
I did not have the chance to thank you.

46:30.037 --> 46:33.248
Have you two met before?

46:33.874 --> 46:36.585
We met at the party in Chwiseonru.

46:37.669 --> 46:39.171
How are your clothes?

46:39.254 --> 46:41.465
I made your seam run.

46:42.758 --> 46:43.967
I am fine.

46:44.468 --> 46:45.719
Seam?

46:45.802 --> 46:47.095
I see.

46:47.679 --> 46:48.805
It is very cold.

46:48.889 --> 46:50.766
Do you not feel cold in those clothes?

46:52.267 --> 46:54.061
Wear this.

46:54.144 --> 46:56.522
I wanted to get you a thank-you gift.

46:59.608 --> 47:02.694
This is a gift, not a bribe.

47:03.278 --> 47:04.404
Here.

47:23.840 --> 47:25.467
It suits you.

47:35.727 --> 47:38.522
Will you be all right wearing that?

47:47.114 --> 47:51.285
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

47:54.454 --> 47:55.497
We will now begin

47:56.248 --> 47:58.750
the Songrim Servant Contest

47:58.834 --> 48:02.754
and pick those of you
who will work in Songrim.

48:03.338 --> 48:05.591
I will read the name list.

48:06.300 --> 48:08.552
Answer me when I call your names.

48:11.430 --> 48:13.515
Number one, Park Jun-hwa.

48:14.099 --> 48:14.975
Here.

48:15.058 --> 48:16.977
Number two, An So-jeong.

48:17.060 --> 48:18.145
Here!

48:19.938 --> 48:21.023
An So-jeong.

48:21.106 --> 48:22.357
TWO

48:22.441 --> 48:23.442
An…

48:25.110 --> 48:27.446
- Number three, Lee Yeong-ok.
- Here.

48:27.529 --> 48:29.406
- Number four, Park Hyeon-su.
- Here.

48:30.407 --> 48:32.701
- Number five, Bae Hui-young.
- Here.

48:40.083 --> 48:41.168
What is this?

48:41.251 --> 48:42.753
I am looking at it just in case.

48:46.548 --> 48:48.884
ONE HUNDRED TWENTY-FIVE, MU-DEOK

48:50.636 --> 48:51.887
There you are.

48:51.970 --> 48:54.848
Number 125, Mu-deok.

48:56.266 --> 48:57.309
Over here!

49:02.481 --> 49:06.401
Your maid, Mu-deok, is in Songrim today.

49:07.611 --> 49:09.363
Let me warn you in advance.

49:09.446 --> 49:10.947
Do not try to leave this room.

49:11.031 --> 49:12.407
Can you keep it down…

49:15.285 --> 49:16.828
Could you be quiet, please?

49:16.912 --> 49:19.373
I need all the concentration
I can get to read this.

49:19.456 --> 49:20.874
I will let you be then.

49:34.388 --> 49:38.141
I will see you again in three days,
Your Royal Highness.

49:38.225 --> 49:42.062
Why is Songrim so busy today?
It is teeming with people.

49:42.896 --> 49:47.150
They are holding a contest
to pick out some servants.

49:47.818 --> 49:50.612
- Do they need to turn it into a contest?
- Your Royal Highness.

49:51.196 --> 49:53.490
Many people
want to work here as a servant.

49:53.573 --> 49:56.702
I saw the maid from the Jang family too.

49:58.078 --> 50:00.163
- Filthy Mu-deok?
- Yes, Your Royal Highness.

50:13.468 --> 50:15.095
Your first test

50:15.679 --> 50:20.225
will require you to read and calculate.

50:21.017 --> 50:22.728
You must get all of them right.

50:22.811 --> 50:25.480
One wrong answer,
and you will be disqualified!

50:29.067 --> 50:30.902
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

50:33.739 --> 50:35.741
Yul!

50:38.076 --> 50:39.411
I found the test papers.

50:41.329 --> 50:43.832
There are many questions.
Even short-answer ones.

50:44.458 --> 50:45.959
Mu-deok is smart,

50:46.042 --> 50:47.544
but will she get them all right?

50:50.756 --> 50:52.132
This is pretty difficult?

50:52.215 --> 50:55.010
Eunuch Oh, what do you need
to wash clothes that have ink on them?

50:55.093 --> 50:56.219
That is a question here.

50:56.303 --> 50:58.680
Rice paste does the trick.

50:59.306 --> 51:00.557
What do you do with it?

51:00.640 --> 51:03.477
First, you apply it on…

51:08.440 --> 51:09.608
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

51:09.691 --> 51:12.694
"You invited 20 individuals each
from 3 different families."

51:12.778 --> 51:16.156
"One table can seat four people.
How many tables do you need?"

51:18.116 --> 51:21.578
Twenty individuals from three families
mean sixty in total.

51:23.663 --> 51:27.292
Since one table can fit four of them,

51:28.168 --> 51:29.419
- it is fifteen.
- No.

51:30.337 --> 51:32.380
They said "three families" on purpose.

51:33.298 --> 51:37.344
Those from the same family
must sit together.

51:38.053 --> 51:40.388
We need more tables
if they will be placed together.

51:40.472 --> 51:42.766
Each family would need nine tables.

51:44.226 --> 51:45.602
That is 27 in total.

51:52.025 --> 51:53.485
This was an invitation.

51:53.568 --> 51:55.111
NINE × THREE = TWENTY-SEVEN

51:55.195 --> 51:57.864
The host needs a table as well.

51:58.615 --> 52:00.158
TWENTY-SEVEN + HOST
= TWENTY…

52:00.242 --> 52:01.743
Twenty-eight in total.

52:04.162 --> 52:06.331
You are right.

52:06.957 --> 52:08.959
TWENTY-EIGHT

52:09.459 --> 52:12.212
Next question is about running errands
and not getting lost.

52:13.004 --> 52:15.382
Let me get a map of the capital.

52:16.633 --> 52:18.802
HOW DO YOU WASH CLOTHES
THAT HAVE INK ON THEM?

52:19.469 --> 52:21.763
What should you do
if there is ink on the clothes?

52:21.847 --> 52:24.474
Should you not just dispose of them?
Eunuch Oh.

52:25.392 --> 52:26.643
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

52:26.726 --> 52:29.729
How do you wash clothes
that have ink on them again?

52:29.813 --> 52:31.898
You need some warm rice paste.

52:31.982 --> 52:33.859
- Smear it on the--
- That is right.

52:34.985 --> 52:36.194
Write it.

52:36.987 --> 52:38.822
"Warm rice paste."

52:39.865 --> 52:41.700
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

52:43.577 --> 52:45.287
We probably got all of them right.

52:45.370 --> 52:47.497
I did not expect to do this with you,
but it was fun.

52:48.123 --> 52:50.458
I can assure you that Mu-deok will fail.

52:54.588 --> 52:59.259
That is why we should deliver
this perfect test paper to her.

53:00.760 --> 53:04.264
But how can we do that?
It will look too obvious if we do it.

53:05.265 --> 53:09.561
Perhaps someone who is more conspicuous
will avoid suspicion.

53:25.452 --> 53:28.121
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

53:29.456 --> 53:30.665
This is hard.

53:31.291 --> 53:33.043
This is more difficult than I thought.

53:35.086 --> 53:37.172
Do not look at other people's papers.

53:40.258 --> 53:43.678
The Crown Prince is here! Bow before him!

53:47.098 --> 53:48.600
Goodness. Your Royal Highness!

53:48.683 --> 53:51.728
- Your Royal Highness!
- Your Royal Highness!

53:57.776 --> 54:01.112
I heard there was an important test,
so I wanted to encourage you.

54:03.156 --> 54:04.699
We are honored to have you here.

54:04.783 --> 54:07.869
Do not mind me and focus on the test.

54:25.887 --> 54:26.805
Focus!

54:28.264 --> 54:29.599
Focus!

54:30.183 --> 54:31.393
Focus!

54:31.476 --> 54:32.811
- You too.
- Focus--

54:33.353 --> 54:34.521
Get back to what you were doing.

55:16.438 --> 55:20.650
I will now announce
those of you who have passed.

55:23.361 --> 55:26.322
Park Jun-hwa, you have passed.

55:27.032 --> 55:29.325
Lee Yeong-ok, failed.

55:29.409 --> 55:32.495
Hwang Yeon-ji, failed.

55:33.329 --> 55:35.373
Oh Jae-ho, you have passed.

55:37.876 --> 55:39.544
Number 125.

55:39.627 --> 55:40.962
Mu-deok.

55:50.930 --> 55:52.348
Your Royal Highness!

55:54.684 --> 55:56.144
She got in!

55:56.227 --> 55:57.771
Yes!

56:02.025 --> 56:03.276
Good work.

56:04.069 --> 56:08.198
Forty of you have passed the first test.

56:08.281 --> 56:11.826
Now comes the practical test.

56:14.329 --> 56:18.708
The practical test
will evaluate them on their duties.

56:19.584 --> 56:20.919
They will prepare ingredients,

56:21.002 --> 56:23.838
clean, and wash clothes.

56:23.922 --> 56:26.382
Lastly, there will be a fitness test.

56:55.703 --> 56:58.331
Number 125, Mu-deok.

56:58.414 --> 56:59.833
You have passed.

57:28.862 --> 57:30.947
Number 125, Mu-deok.

57:31.030 --> 57:31.948
You have passed!

57:34.993 --> 57:36.161
ONE HUNDRED TWENTY-FIVE

57:46.880 --> 57:48.840
Number 125, Mu-deok.

57:49.340 --> 57:50.675
You have passed!

57:53.970 --> 57:56.514
Gosh, Mu-deok is impressive.

57:56.598 --> 57:58.391
Now, it is the fitness test.

57:58.475 --> 58:00.393
We should go and cheer for her.

58:01.144 --> 58:04.063
I saw many fit individuals back there.

58:04.147 --> 58:06.399
I highly doubt she will be
one of the last five.

58:06.483 --> 58:08.735
Your Royal Highness,
thank you for helping us.

58:09.319 --> 58:10.278
Goodbye.

58:12.572 --> 58:14.699
- Let us go.
- All right.

58:17.243 --> 58:21.164
That was his way of telling me
not to come, right?

58:21.247 --> 58:23.666
Goodness, why did they have to be so mean?

58:23.750 --> 58:25.877
Unbelievable.

58:26.794 --> 58:28.379
Forget it. Let us go.

58:29.172 --> 58:30.465
Your Royal Highness, it is this way.

58:33.468 --> 58:35.470
- I know.
- Of course, Your Royal Highness.

58:36.471 --> 58:40.892
You will travel five ri
and bring back some water.

58:40.975 --> 58:42.435
Those who are the first five

58:43.102 --> 58:46.397
to arrive will be the final winners.

58:47.649 --> 58:48.900
This is the last hurdle.

58:50.109 --> 58:52.111
I must be in the first five.

59:04.290 --> 59:05.124
Go!

59:13.716 --> 59:16.844
He has been looking
at Words of the Heart for days on end.

59:18.596 --> 59:19.722
Is that so?

59:27.981 --> 59:29.983
It will not happen that soon.

59:30.066 --> 59:31.526
Have patience.

59:33.736 --> 59:35.029
Yes, my lord.

59:35.738 --> 59:39.033
Maidservant Kim is worried sick about you.

59:39.909 --> 59:41.703
Let me know if you need anything.

59:41.786 --> 59:45.957
I will prepare your bed, food,
and clothes to your liking.

59:47.792 --> 59:49.210
I am fine.

59:58.386 --> 01:00:00.722
The wind is getting chillier now.

01:00:00.805 --> 01:00:03.224
Keep the windows closed.

01:00:04.767 --> 01:00:08.938
Master Seo Gyeong wrote this
for a lady who could not see

01:00:09.022 --> 01:00:11.983
so that she could read it with her heart.

01:00:13.610 --> 01:00:15.236
I have one question.

01:00:16.321 --> 01:00:20.199
Did Master Seo Gyeong know
of a woman who could not see?

01:00:24.078 --> 01:00:26.456
During the Great Chaos
that occurred 200 years ago,

01:00:27.123 --> 01:00:29.375
the first leader of Jinyowon

01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:31.836
was the one who helped
Master Seo Gyeong by his side.

01:00:31.919 --> 01:00:34.881
And she could not see.

01:00:36.090 --> 01:00:39.844
He had written this love letter
for the leader of Jinyowon.

01:00:41.721 --> 01:00:45.808
By the way, are you sure
you can let others read this?

01:00:46.476 --> 01:00:48.603
What if these are his private thoughts

01:00:48.686 --> 01:00:50.772
that you are making everyone read?

01:00:54.817 --> 01:00:57.820
You must be trying to use me
to read what is written in there.

01:00:58.488 --> 01:01:00.281
I will tell you this.

01:01:00.365 --> 01:01:05.411
Those words have nothing to do
with his private thoughts.

01:01:07.664 --> 01:01:12.210
Countless mages have read this,
but no one knows that fact.

01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:15.630
Right. No one knows
that it is a love letter.

01:01:15.713 --> 01:01:17.674
Instead of coming up with tricks,

01:01:17.757 --> 01:01:20.218
you should focus more
on training yourself.

01:01:21.010 --> 01:01:24.222
How could no one know
that this is a love letter?

01:01:29.143 --> 01:01:32.480
You can read it by training
your concentration skills.

01:01:32.563 --> 01:01:37.151
But try to think of another way
since I told you it was a love letter.

01:01:37.985 --> 01:01:41.656
There must be a different way
to read this love letter.

01:01:42.699 --> 01:01:44.867
Those who read this
through training do not know.

01:01:44.951 --> 01:01:47.453
Only those who are aware
that it is a love letter can read it.

01:01:48.037 --> 01:01:49.414
But how?

01:01:49.497 --> 01:01:52.667
How does a love letter begin?

01:02:03.720 --> 01:02:05.138
I have one last question.

01:02:06.097 --> 01:02:07.765
What was the name

01:02:08.766 --> 01:02:10.309
of the first leader of Jinyowon?

01:02:22.613 --> 01:02:24.532
All love letters begin

01:02:25.992 --> 01:02:27.869
with the recipient's name.

01:02:28.786 --> 01:02:29.912
Her surname

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:33.666
was Jin, and her first name was Seol-ran.

01:02:34.667 --> 01:02:37.003
The recipient's name was Seol-ran.

01:02:37.086 --> 01:02:38.713
"An orchid that blooms

01:02:39.881 --> 01:02:41.174
in the white snow."

01:02:42.759 --> 01:02:43.968
Her name

01:02:45.178 --> 01:02:47.054
will open this letter.

01:03:14.624 --> 01:03:19.837
YOU CANNOT GRASP WATER
BUT IT IS INSIDE THE SOIL

01:03:25.551 --> 01:03:26.761
I can read it.

01:03:34.936 --> 01:03:36.938
Hey, there she is.

01:03:38.940 --> 01:03:40.566
There is Mu-deok.

01:03:55.122 --> 01:03:56.666
"You cannot grasp water,

01:03:58.167 --> 01:03:59.710
but it is inside the soil."

01:04:01.504 --> 01:04:03.548
"You cannot touch fire,

01:04:03.631 --> 01:04:05.049
but it is inside the tree."

01:04:07.385 --> 01:04:09.262
"You cannot hold the wind,

01:04:10.888 --> 01:04:12.348
but it is resting on the rock."

01:04:14.058 --> 01:04:17.812
"If you let them be,
they will exist everywhere."

01:04:19.605 --> 01:04:21.023
"The faint, blue light

01:04:22.692 --> 01:04:24.026
makes me sigh."

01:04:26.863 --> 01:04:29.031
"My white breath

01:04:29.615 --> 01:04:31.826
turned into snow and tears."

01:04:32.952 --> 01:04:35.746
"I could not let them drop and hid them."

01:04:37.331 --> 01:04:40.084
"Despite knowing that
they will fill up once again,

01:04:40.793 --> 01:04:45.131
I am a fool
who dares not shed a single tear."

01:04:50.428 --> 01:04:52.054
Those two are already back.

01:04:54.682 --> 01:04:55.892
I do not see Mu-deok.

01:05:04.483 --> 01:05:06.569
There are six people in front of Mu-deok.

01:05:06.652 --> 01:05:08.863
She needs to beat
at least two of them to win.

01:05:19.332 --> 01:05:22.418
I AM A FOOL
WHO DARES NOT SHED A SINGLE TEAR

01:05:29.717 --> 01:05:31.928
YOU CANNOT GRASP WATER
BUT IT IS INSIDE THE SOIL

01:05:38.559 --> 01:05:39.644
Where are you going?

01:05:40.686 --> 01:05:41.854
Right.

01:05:44.315 --> 01:05:45.399
I read it.

01:06:07.838 --> 01:06:08.839
Number 29,

01:06:08.923 --> 01:06:10.800
Jang Jeong-do. You have passed.

01:06:11.801 --> 01:06:14.011
Only one more remains.

01:06:47.003 --> 01:06:49.088
I do not need a pupil
who does not improve.

01:06:49.588 --> 01:06:51.674
Just die if you are
not going to do anything.

01:06:52.717 --> 01:06:54.719
Hey! That is dangerous!

01:06:54.802 --> 01:06:56.512
You are no longer Naksu.

01:07:03.185 --> 01:07:05.146
No matter how pathetic you feel,

01:07:06.230 --> 01:07:08.315
you must do what you can at the moment.

01:07:10.776 --> 01:07:12.653
If I am not willing to do anything,

01:07:14.238 --> 01:07:15.698
I might as well just die.

01:07:35.176 --> 01:07:37.053
Number 125, Mu-deok.

01:07:39.472 --> 01:07:40.806
You have passed!

01:07:48.355 --> 01:07:49.940
YOU CANNOT GRASP WATER
BUT IT IS INSIDE THE SOIL

01:07:50.024 --> 01:07:52.818
It is exactly identical
to Words of the Heart.

01:07:53.527 --> 01:07:55.446
Jang Uk accomplished the task.

01:07:57.865 --> 01:07:59.325
He accomplished the task?

01:08:04.163 --> 01:08:07.333
- Where is he right now?
- He is at Sejukwon.

01:08:07.416 --> 01:08:10.711
The maid who was always with him
collapsed while taking the test,

01:08:10.795 --> 01:08:12.004
so he took her there.

01:08:13.172 --> 01:08:14.340
His maid?

01:08:15.007 --> 01:08:16.967
- Do you mean Mu-deok?
- Yes, my lord.

01:08:17.051 --> 01:08:19.011
She passed the test today.

01:08:19.720 --> 01:08:21.931
She did pass out at the finish line,

01:08:22.014 --> 01:08:24.058
but she did indeed make it.

01:08:24.767 --> 01:08:26.018
Is that so?

01:08:30.314 --> 01:08:33.651
My maid only risked her life
by doing what she was told to do.

01:08:34.360 --> 01:08:35.736
It was all my doing.

01:08:48.749 --> 01:08:50.084
Now that I think of it,

01:08:51.836 --> 01:08:54.004
she was always beside Uk.

01:08:56.048 --> 01:08:57.716
His maid, Mu-deok…

01:09:03.556 --> 01:09:07.351
The book that I read was actually
Master Seo Gyeong's love letter.

01:09:10.146 --> 01:09:11.313
Really?

01:09:12.148 --> 01:09:14.233
Then why did he make it invisible?

01:09:14.984 --> 01:09:18.571
The woman could not see.
He wanted her to read with her heart.

01:09:19.947 --> 01:09:21.407
How wistful.

01:09:21.991 --> 01:09:23.117
I do not think

01:09:23.951 --> 01:09:25.703
the letter was sent.

01:09:26.453 --> 01:09:28.539
If it was, it would have been in Jinyowon,

01:09:29.290 --> 01:09:30.875
not Songrim.

01:09:31.458 --> 01:09:34.628
An invisible love letter
that was never sent?

01:09:36.755 --> 01:09:37.840
What a coward.

01:09:39.800 --> 01:09:42.136
He wrote down his feelings
without her knowing.

01:09:43.637 --> 01:09:45.014
What a foolish

01:09:46.348 --> 01:09:47.892
and pitiful love letter.

01:09:53.522 --> 01:09:55.441
You are right. He should have…

01:09:58.527 --> 01:10:00.362
delivered the letter like you did.

01:10:01.822 --> 01:10:04.450
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

01:10:05.826 --> 01:10:07.286
That is not a letter.

01:10:07.369 --> 01:10:08.746
What is there to a letter?

01:10:08.829 --> 01:10:11.540
As long as it delivers your feelings.

01:10:13.083 --> 01:10:15.586
Wait there. I will go to you soon.

01:10:15.669 --> 01:10:17.421
Do not get caught and get back safely.

01:10:26.805 --> 01:10:30.976
You must have pitied me
for trying to get in here as a servant.

01:10:31.977 --> 01:10:34.605
You used to be
an incredibly experienced master.

01:10:35.105 --> 01:10:36.899
I did feel bad for you.

01:10:37.858 --> 01:10:40.361
I guess I helped you learn
about loyalty and duties.

01:10:40.444 --> 01:10:42.488
Seeing how far you would go as my master,

01:10:42.571 --> 01:10:45.950
I did think that I should do my best.

01:10:48.244 --> 01:10:49.954
You must have felt pressured.

01:10:50.746 --> 01:10:53.540
Not really. But I was in a dilemma.

01:10:54.333 --> 01:10:59.088
I did not know if I should reply
as your young master or pupil.

01:10:59.672 --> 01:11:02.424
Or just reply based on what I read.

01:11:08.264 --> 01:11:09.807
What did you read?

01:11:10.724 --> 01:11:14.436
Then should I also reply
based on what I read?

01:11:16.063 --> 01:11:17.606
Also? What do you mean?

01:11:18.148 --> 01:11:22.278
It is written here.
"I will go this far just to see you."

01:11:22.987 --> 01:11:26.282
"I can do anything
if it means being able to see you."

01:11:26.907 --> 01:11:28.284
And this is my reply.

01:11:33.414 --> 01:11:37.876
I should have braced myself
before letting him get this close to me.

01:11:42.006 --> 01:11:43.507
I also missed you.

01:11:47.428 --> 01:11:48.762
That is my reply.

01:11:57.938 --> 01:11:59.732
What I gave him

01:12:01.275 --> 01:12:05.279
should not have been read
or delivered in the first place.

01:12:07.156 --> 01:12:08.782
It was my foolish and pathetic

01:12:10.576 --> 01:12:12.161
love letter.

01:12:43.567 --> 01:12:45.194
I miss you first thing in the morning,

01:12:45.277 --> 01:12:47.196
- all throughout the day--
- Stop.

01:12:47.279 --> 01:12:49.365
It is a terrible poison you cannot escape,

01:12:49.448 --> 01:12:51.408
as its only antidote is
the person it is from.

01:12:51.492 --> 01:12:52.868
Are you out of your mind?

01:12:52.951 --> 01:12:54.828
This is just a symptom.
I have been poisoned.

01:12:54.912 --> 01:12:58.040
So the only one in your mind
has been Jang Uk, Naksu.

01:12:58.123 --> 01:13:00.250
You did not believe me
when I said I was in love with you.

01:13:00.334 --> 01:13:02.294
Then do a better job
and make me believe it.

01:13:02.378 --> 01:13:04.838
That is the most precious object
I have ever received.

01:13:04.922 --> 01:13:07.841
Please do your best
so you can win it back.

01:13:07.925 --> 01:13:10.719
I have made a bet with your maid, Mu-deok.

01:13:10.803 --> 01:13:13.013
Fight and perish, Jang Uk.

01:13:13.097 --> 01:13:14.181
When I said I missed you,

01:13:14.264 --> 01:13:15.682
is this what you meant
when you said you had my weakness?

01:13:15.766 --> 01:13:17.101
Do not go.

01:13:17.768 --> 01:13:21.397
I like Mu-deok a lot.

01:13:25.025 --> 01:13:30.030
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
